"""Independent audit of an enforcer build.  Usage: check <build-dir>

Every case follows from a sentence of docs/rules.md or of the Interface in
docs/enforcer.md (hash of src: docs/judge.md).  Fixture trees are real git
repositories made in a temp dir.  One line per case, then <passed>/<total>.
"""
